{"4235170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fables of Dwale", "steam_appid": 4235170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every fairytale has an end—but what happens after?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/59c89e2b01d1230453adf86f149b76fb.poster.avif?t=1779986192\" width=832 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/59c89e2b01d1230453adf86f149b76fb.webm?t=1779986192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/59c89e2b01d1230453adf86f149b76fb.mp4?t=1779986192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A darkness has fallen over the enchanted lands, leaving people sick and weak. Explore the world as Red Riding Hood, forage fruit and fungi, barter with folk of fables, and find a cure for the creeping illness they call the Dwale. But beware nightfall: Sleep until dawn, or roam the dark to find secrets the night hides. Keep your lantern lit, lest you fall victim to the very illness you’re looking to cure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Lands and Meet Legendary Characters </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/3745ea397d748b618b630eff70545f39.poster.avif?t=1779986192\" width=832 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/3745ea397d748b618b630eff70545f39.webm?t=1779986192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/3745ea397d748b618b630eff70545f39.mp4?t=1779986192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the ailing town of Dawnhollow in the Enchanted Forest, to the toxic swamps of the Murkmire, or the icy tundra of the Nanuk Mountains—every biome holds its own myths, its own perilous quests and dangers, and its own fabled characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your Basket</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/42ac77fe17f00b1b2d6cccf1ed99ed96.poster.avif?t=1779986192\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/42ac77fe17f00b1b2d6cccf1ed99ed96.webm?t=1779986192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/42ac77fe17f00b1b2d6cccf1ed99ed96.mp4?t=1779986192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The things you keep in your basket want to be stacked carefully. Place heavy, sturdy items at the bottom and light, fragile ones at the top, or you may find things squished and destroyed the next time you look inside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Dark</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/51be9ebaeff36c7bc635f2d116ac96dc.poster.avif?t=1779986192\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/51be9ebaeff36c7bc635f2d116ac96dc.webm?t=1779986192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/51be9ebaeff36c7bc635f2d116ac96dc.mp4?t=1779986192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the night, your lantern is your lifeline to elude the darkness. But the creatures of the night will do everything in their power to steal it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the Cure</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/8463db0c4ed1d00a6f1fa6facff3c39b.poster.avif?t=1779986192\" width=832 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/8463db0c4ed1d00a6f1fa6facff3c39b.webm?t=1779986192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/8463db0c4ed1d00a6f1fa6facff3c39b.mp4?t=1779986192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange, dark plague is infesting the land. The Lantern King, the ominous ruler of the Enchanted Forest, claims he’s manufacturing a cure. Does he know more than he’s letting on? Can you afford to trust him? Or… can you afford not to?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every fairytale has an end—but what happens after?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/59c89e2b01d1230453adf86f149b76fb.poster.avif?t=1779986192\" width=832 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4235170/extras/59c89e2b01d1230453adf86f149b76fb.webm?t=1779986192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so